  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.7.0 - MarkdownView for real apps. The view scrolls from the keyboard (Up/Down, PageUp/PageDown, Home/End) with key hints, and is focusable with an opt-in Tab stop (IsFocusStop). UseThemeStyles makes it follow the app theme without painting theme backgrounds, and MarkdownRenderOptions.WithTheme and MarkdownStyles.FromTheme(theme, includeBackgrounds) do the same for direct renders, with ASCII glyphs on ASCII themes. SetSearch, FindNext, FindPrevious, and F3 search the rendered text, highlighted with the new Theme.SearchMatchRole (Pane follows it too). TailFollow keeps a growing document at its end with a new-below indicator. MarkdownRenderer.StreamingPrefix exposes the rule that holds back half-received table rows and unconfirmed headers while a reply streams, and MarkdownLayoutCache caches layouts for apps that draw Markdown in their own widgets. Additive; new behavior is opt-in, and the few visible changes are listed under Changed. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
